(7434720, 1174541, 175821, '<td valign="top">LOL....you have to submit EVERY photo? Come on...why wouldn''t ONE with the correct date/time stamp?<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Mond:</b></div><hr/><i> The image was a focus stack of around 10 images. I made a tiff of the stack and used this as my original. I neither have the inclination to store all the focus stack images I take nor the time to upload 10 full-size images given the alarmingly slow nature of the process. Unfortunately the fuddy-duddys didn''t see it this way. </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'LOL....you have to submit EVERY photo? Come on...why wouldn''t ONE with the correct date/time stamp? Originally posted by Mond: The image was a focus stack of around 10 images. I made a tiff of the stack and used this as my original. I neither have the inclination to store all the focus stack images I take nor the time to upload 10 full-size images given the alarmingly slow nature of the process. Unfortunately the fuddy-duddys didn''t see it this way. ', '2016-02-04 21:56:47.000000', NULL, 0),
